  "prefLabel": "Ncr 855.01 Penalties",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 855.01 Penalties. A person who violates any rule of Ncr 850 shall be guilty of a violation as provided for by RSA 215-A:19, I and RSA 215-C:34, I and shall be subject to a fine pursuant to RSA 651:2, III-a, and IV(a), Ncr 782.04, and Ncr 782.06.\n\nSource. #14288, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr800.html"
